RELEASE HISTORY
---------------

1.06 21/01/2014
+ Added output_type/output_title settings for use by ADD_to_i2b2 script
+ Cell count section with 'sputum' page extracted from bsd page in DAC
* Changes to ensure compatibility with core 1.0.16
1.05 21/10/2013
Added the add allergen panel option to the 2 existing options and removed the separate button. Also included Date and Examiner options.
Changed Flaring to Y/N field, set default date of visit blank and added comment box. Also added additional consultants.
Moved allergen report to top menu bar and also display the actual visit date rather than the create date for the record
Allergen testers dictionary updated.
Modified AddStandardTests field to remove updates to tester and date for these tests.

1.04 25/09/2013
Added continuous to drug duration options
Added adverse reactions to drugs reports and changed drugs report to an option (rather than button in drugs page)
Moved the medication sections into a new med module

1.03 21/08/2013
Minor changes to report field properties (e.g. size)
Minor tweaks to adherence assessment and allergen result forms. Most improvement are in the core framework.

1.02 16/08/2013
Fixed the allergen test form which required some changes to core Components and Fields.

1.01 15/08/2013
Renamed the adherence report from drugs-report to adherence-report and made changes to the drugs form.
New Drugs report is a drugs list. Changes also include custom report fields for the table - to deal with logic displays.

1.00 12/08/2013
Initial full release of investigations module


